umb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/SpecialBuff-101.png/48px-SpecialBuff-101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/96/SpecialBuff-101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"60\" /><div class=\"battle-unit-buff-name\">福祉</div><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"min-width: 170px; padding:12px; transform: translate(-50%); bottom: 30px;\">受到非克制攻击时，获得<span class=\"color-value\">100%</span>暴击防御；单次受到伤害不超过<span class=\"color-value\">30</span>段生命；若已损失<span class=\"color-value\">20/40/100</span>段生命，受到的本源创伤降低<span class=\"color-value\">30%/60%/90%</span>，获得<span class=\"color-value\">20%/40%/60%</span>最终免伤，获得<span class=\"color-value\">0%/40%/60%</span>最终增伤；之后每损失<span class=\"color-value\">100</span>段生命，获得<span class=\"color-value\">5%</span>最终减伤，<span class=\"color-value\">10%</span>最终增伤（最多获得<span class=\"color-value\">6</span>次）；若已损失<span class=\"color-value\">40/100</span>段生命，自身效果获得<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>次/<span class=\"color-value\">2</span>次提升</span></div><div class=\"battle-unit-buff tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help;\"><img alt=\"SpecialBuff-104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/SpecialBuff-104.png/32px-SpecialBuff-104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/SpecialBuff-104.png/48px-SpecialBuff-104.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/65/SpecialBuff-104.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"60\" /><div class=\"battle-unit-buff-name\">再造</div><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"min-width: 170px; padding:12px; transform: translate(-50%); bottom: 30px;\">回合开始时，若不在<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">目击回合</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">目击回合中，敌方无法主动行动；进入目击回合时，战斗回合上限随着提升</span></span>中，获得<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>层<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span sty